# All text files are normalized to LF in the repository and checked out as LF.
# `text=auto` lets git skip auto-detected binaries; `eol=lf` keeps the working
# tree LF on every platform so `biome format` (which expects LF) stays green.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Defense in depth: never run line-ending normalization on these asset types.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.tgs binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary
